notes=("Kept all 6 old kinds; added Superyacht and Narrowboat (old 'Narrowboat' model moved out of Houseboat into its own kind). "
"Trimmed RIB flat list from 21 to 6 (AB Inflatables 5->2, Achilles 4->1, Zodiac 4->3; Highfield models became versions of Classic/Patrol/Ultralite archetypes; CL-400 dropped as SKU). "
"Cabin cruiser: Sea Ray 250/300/340 Sundancer folded into the Sundancer archetype. Dutch barge placed under Houseboat. "
"Left out: Sunseeker Manhattan (heritage page 404, no other retrieved source); Azimut and Riva yacht lines (retrieved pages name no current lines; Riva Aquarama is a runabout for shelf 06_02); "
"Zodiac Cadet/Yachtline as archetypes and narrowboat builders (no retrieved source); Grand Banks founding year (sources conflict). Riva brand already in register via 06_02.")
